 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789890/extras/56a4a74b1e4217061e1153f086624760.poster.avif?t=1747050965\" width=644 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789890/extras/56a4a74b1e4217061e1153f086624760.webm?t=1747050965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789890/extras/56a4a74b1e4217061e1153f086624760.mp4?t=1747050965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission Requirements:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No handholding.<br>No excuses.<br>Just you, your paws, and the chaos of Roo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Report for duty, Agent Furr.</strong><br>It\u2019s time to bear the burden of knowledge.<br>The fate of the universe may rest on your furr.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you learn to bear?</strong> \ud83d\udc3b</p>",
